          "title": "The Space Rule",
          "text": "`\"${arr[@]: -1}\"` needs the space — `\"${arr[@]:-1}\"` parses as the default operator and yields `1`."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "File to Array"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "mapfile -t lines < file.txt",
